                <pb facs="0296" n="230" sameAs="frus:frus1934v05/pg230"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">816.01/359: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Lane</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-01-15T14:00:00-05:00">January 15, 1934—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>6. Your 11, January 14, midnight, first paragraph. Legation in Guatemala City has
                    been instructed to communicate with President Ubico in the sense suggested.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
